menu "TrailCurrent Power Dashboard"

# Broker host, username and password are NOT here on purpose. They are
# entered on the panel's Headwaters screen and stored in NVS -- a credential in
# sdkconfig.defaults would be committed, and one in sdkconfig alone cannot be
# changed without a rebuild and a cable. See main/UI/broker_cfg.h.

config DASH_MQTT_KEEPALIVE
    int "MQTT keepalive (seconds)"
    default 60
    help
        60 s rather than the IDF default of 120. On the P4 the Wi-Fi link runs
        over SDIO to the C6, and a PINGRESP that arrives late enough for the
        client to give up shows as a connect/disconnect flap roughly every
        30 s, with the broker logging "closed by client". A shorter keepalive
        paired with a longer network timeout is what settles it.

config DASH_MQTT_TIMEOUT_MS
    int "MQTT network timeout (ms)"
    default 20000
    help
        See DASH_MQTT_KEEPALIVE. The IDF default of 10 s is not enough headroom
        on this transport.

endmenu
